 FSNotify secs;fsnote
 :Trap 6
     'fsnote'⎕WC'Form'('AlphaBlend' 192)('MinButton' 0)('MaxButton' 0)('SysMenu' 0)('Moveable' 0)('Sizeable' 0)('Coord' 'Pixel')('Border' 1)
     'fsnote.l'⎕WC'Label' 'To exit full screen, press F11'('Posn' 0 0)('Justify' 'Centre')('FontObj'(1.5⌊⍤×@2⊢'Segoe UI' 800@1 6⊢⎕SE.FontObj))
     fsnote.(Size←2×l.Size)
     fsnote.l.Posn←fsnote.l.Size÷2
     fsnote.Posn←⎕SE.Posn+2 0.5×⎕SE.Size[2]-@2⊢fsnote.Size
     ⎕DL secs
     {fsnote.AlphaBlend←⍵⊣⎕DL 0.05}¨16×12-⍳11
 :EndTrap
